OL,3,GNEWSA'Boys feel they can't talk - a
OL,4,Amentor helped me'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has said a mentoring
OL,7,Forganisation highlighted by Sir Gareth
OL,8,FSouthgate has helped him "become a
OL,9,Fbetter person".
OL,11,FFrankie, 15, from Hertfordshire, said
OL,12,Fhe found it hard to talk after the
OL,13,Fdeath of his grandfather.
OL,15,FHe received support from Dan Gaze
OL,16,FSupport Services and this summer helped
OL,17,Fout at free football sessions for other
OL,18,Fyoung people.
OL,20,FGaze said he wanted "to help support
OL,21,Fyoung boys and young girls to do well".
